{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_02",
  "title": "热情，或悲怆",
  "storyCode": "LE-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b5c29e00fd3ac9f987353cefc887f0ab1f2910c789d74421ad63cbd243eb08ad",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行板竭力为芙蓉抵挡着人潮，但一个人的力量实在太过渺小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人群很快越过行板，将芙蓉团团围住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "别让我说第二遍，滚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "你们到底在干什么？！她是来帮你们的，你们为什么要这么做？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "行板，这事跟你没关系！要是想保护这个魔族佬，就赶紧让她离开夕照区！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这——\n这是怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "白垩？芙蓉在里面......她被人围攻了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "让开，让开——让我进去！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "你又是从哪儿冒出来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "哦，我想起来了，你是之前流浪到夕照区的那小子吧？乖乖照顾你爷爷去，别多管闲事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "芙蓉她明明是来帮助大家的，你们为什么要这么对她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "你这种人根本不可能懂，我们是在从魔族佬手里保护自己的家园！滚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "芙蓉不是这样的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我只知道芙蓉是来治矿石病的，她全心全意扑在这件事上，你们不也都看在眼里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "治矿石病？谁的矿石病被她治好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "白垩，你别来蹚这摊浑水，这里毕竟是维谢海姆，他们不敢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "谁说我不敢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "大提琴？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你疯了吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "有什么事情冲我来，为什么要冲着他施术？这事跟他有什么关系？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "我......我没想冲着人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "没什么好解释的！再不走，你们就要和这把大提琴一样，身上开个洞了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "笛声？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "又从哪冒出来一个碍事的，出来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "我——心跳得好快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "*莱塔尼亚粗口*，他怎么冒出来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "大家，大家别走啊，怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "你还没听见吗，那个声音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "......难道是......难道是那位——难道是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "您千万开恩，您手下留情，您——我就是多喝了几口，绝对没有对您不敬的意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "——我到底在干什么啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人群......\n这么快就散了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "白垩，你怎么样？没受伤吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我没事，可是琴......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊，这大提琴......面板破得这么严重，还能修吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "多谢你出手相助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "初次见面——应该不是初次见面了吧。不过，我们一直没能好好打个招呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "说实话，刚才还挺危险的。虽然夕照区也是维谢海姆的一部分，但一般的治安官可不想来这儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "如果他们真的动了手，短时间内未必会有人来帮你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "再次向你表示感谢。我该怎么称呼你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "直接叫我黑键就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那，黑键，他们说的预言，你听说过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "完全没有。我也是刚刚从人群口中听见这个词的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "也就是说，这个预言完全没有传到高庭区，是吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "高庭区？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "维谢海姆的贵族应该都住在高庭区，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "别把我和他们相提并论。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊？你不是维谢海姆的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我的确不是维谢海姆本地人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "另外，随意推测一位贵族的身份可不是什么礼貌的举动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那你是专程来夕照区参加车尔尼先生的音乐会的？你也是感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不好意思，我并未感染矿石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "可我听别人说，来这儿参加音乐会的都是感染者——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "对话就到此为止吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你很着急？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我当然着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我和白垩本来想去车尔尼先生家，请他验收我们今天练琴的成果，结果遇到了这档事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "抱歉，耽误了你的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我先回办事处了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "好啦，别伤心了，先去车尔尼家吧。他那么喜欢你，会给你重新挑一把琴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "呃，我不是那个意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "......没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不过也真奇怪，我完全没听过什么“陛下的预言”啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（难道是格特鲁德？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我倒是隐隐约约听过一些......但是很模糊，也没提什么萨卡兹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "唉，算了，音乐会要紧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这群人也真是，要是真喜欢，就应该去女皇之声面前一口一个“那位陛下”“那位陛下”，那才好玩呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不说这些了，我们赶紧去车尔尼家吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "可是，琴......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不是说过了吗，车尔尼会给你挑一把的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "再说，这也不是你的错，就算车尔尼要跟你计较这把琴，也还有我呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "琴坏了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "难道你们也去打架斗殴了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不是这样的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "白垩，你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "来的路上，我和黑键遇到了芙蓉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "芙蓉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "她被一帮人围攻了，那些人说她是魔族，会给夕照区带来灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "无稽之谈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我想去保护芙蓉，结果......大提琴被法术打坏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "在街上放法术，这群人脑子到底出了什么毛病！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "然后你打退了他们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "不，是黑键用法术驱散了人群，帮我和芙蓉解了围。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "他？帮你解围？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "行，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "这把坏琴......唉，像样的大提琴，我也只有这一把啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "对不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "别道歉了，这不是你的错，反而是我，应该代表夕照区，替那些蠢货给你道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "总之你先把琴放这儿吧，我再找找看，有没有别的琴给你用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "就剩这把量产货了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你先凑合一下，我来验收你们练习的成果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "开始吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "车尔尼先生，您......意下如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "进步不是没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "而且对你们来说，这是首只练了一天的新曲子，我也不应该要求太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "但之前的问题，几乎一个也没解决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "几乎一个也没解决？怎么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "黑键反应的速度快了不少，可还是会在自己的段落忘乎所以，好像在炫耀什么一样，最后还是要白垩来迁就你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "连曲子都还没完全熟悉，有什么好炫耀的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "还有那些装饰音，倒是都吹出来了，可是连气息都快不稳了，有意义吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "白垩呢，还是比较扎实的，主要的问题也是熟练度，再练练应该会好很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "但《晨暮》再怎么说也是二重奏，不可能让一方一直迁就另一方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "说实话，我真的想撤掉《晨暮》了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "车尔尼先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "直接说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "可不可以这样，让黑键配合您的钢琴伴奏再试一次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你确定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我可不会像你一样迁就他，他出丑可不要怪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "没事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "（小声）打起精神来，要一战定胜负了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "做好准备了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "——怎么样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "车尔尼先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "那股炫耀的劲头完全没变。你觉得长笛是什么？你炫技的工具吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "但是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我完全没打算配合你的节奏，你自己的部分还是比较稳定地完成了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我看出来了，白垩确实是在迁就你，但他只是在迁就你的习惯，不是在迁就你的水平。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "有待提高的地方还有一大堆，但最低标准，你算是摸到了边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "也就是说......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "通过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（长出一口气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "丑话说在前头，我今天的标准已经拉到最低了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我会随时找你们验收成果，如果在演出前还是只有这种水平的话，我一样不让你们上台，明白了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "您放心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "再有，白垩现在用的这把琴是把量产品，只是应急用的，我还是推荐你们换一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "可是您原来送我的那把已经......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "没关系，有我呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "明天我们一起去买琴，我给你挑一把最好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻信的感染者",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "所以说是那位陛下啊，那位陛下的预言！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻信的感染者",
      "text": "不得了，咱们边走边说，你再详细讲讲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
